Hi Erin,

If you want to try to use the original data, I suggest that you first define the projection to the Conic projection and then reproject to geographic projection. I think that the error message that you got is due to the problem on your rasters when you just define it to be “+proj=longlat +ellps=WGS84 +datum=WGS84 +no_defs”. Also, WorldClim data is a good workaround. If you want to have the last version of Worldclim, you can download directly on worldclim.org <http://worldclim.org>.

Best,
Gonzalo

